  "summary": "A visual style characterized by the distinctive 8x8 pixel blocks that appear in heavily compressed JPEG images.",
  "description": "It manifests as visible square patterns and color banding in areas of gradual tone transitions, resulting from the JPEG compression algorithm's discrete cosine transformation. This became unintentionally iconic with early digital photography and web imagery before compression improved.",
